# TapToReview — Project Architecture & Implementation Documentation

This document serves as the comprehensive technical reference for the TapToReview multi-tenant SaaS architecture, tracking system, and Supabase integration.

---

## 1. System Architecture Overview

The system bridges a lightweight static frontend (hosted on GitHub Pages) with a backend-less PostgreSQL database managed via Supabase. It uses client-side routing to handle dynamic short links without a traditional server runtime.

* **Frontend Hosting:** Static site deployed via GitHub Pages across independent domains (`taptoreview.in`, `taptofollow.in`, `taptowhatsapp.in`).
* **Backend & Database:** Supabase (PostgreSQL) handling real-time data ingestion, atomic analytics counters, and multi-tenant isolation via platform identifiers.
* **Redirection Engine:** A custom catch-all `404.html` script that intercepts non-existent path requests, looks up the target destination, tracks metrics, and executes instantaneous client-side redirects.

